# Post-squash-merge gap fix: the entries above for c0b4e45 (PR #54) and
# 2147c91/da8f386/2a265a1/333e372 (PR #58) reference the PRE-squash commit
# hashes from those branches. After squash-merging, master carries a NEW
# commit (a different hash, same tree) — fingerprint matching is exact on
# commit hash, so those entries never actually suppressed anything on
